RCNO^실명확인번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
WRPL_TELNO^직장전화번호^15^0^0^0^0^0^0
CLPH_TELNO^휴대폰전화번호^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
OWHS_TELNO^자택전화번호^40^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO_PIP^실명확인번호PIP^68^0^0^0^0^0^0
LOGN_ID^로그인ID^16^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="97" _ulen="77" >

PROS_CLS_CODE^처리구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
